==================================================
AI FALLBACK RULES
==================================================

AI-generated rules must NEVER directly enter production runtime.

Generated rules must pass:
- regex safety validation
- duplication checks
- false-positive checks
- performance validation

Only validated rules can:
- be stored in PostgreSQL
- trigger runtime reload

==================================================
API DESIGN
==================================================

Endpoint:
POST /check

Request Example:
{
  "request_id": "abc123",
  "content": "DROP TABLE users"
}

PASS Response:
{
